  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "Appears on all reels. \nSubstitutes for all symbols except                .\nRegardless
      of a win combination, each Wild contributes to relevant Progression."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: 'Each Wild contributes to the relevant Progression Bar.

      Depending on the Progression type, different Wheel Bonus is triggered.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "Player can win one of the followings:\n   - Coin Prize\n   - + 1 Diamond
      to Jekyll Diamond\n      Progression\n   - +1 Diamond to BOTH Diamond\n      Progressions\n
      \  - Mysterious Dr. Jekyll Free Games"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "Player can win one of the followings:\n   - Coin Prize\n   - + 1 Diamond
      to Hyde Diamond\n      Progression\n   - +1 Diamond to BOTH Diamond\n      Progressions\n
      \  - Furious Mr. Hyde Free Games"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "3                   on reels 2, 3 and 4\n\ntriggers Pick Bonus.\nPlayer
      is allowed to pick until winning Coin prize + Collect.\nPick Bonus awards the
      followings:\n   - Coin prize\n   - Coin prize + Collect\n   - Wheel\nPicking
      3 Wheel elements triggers the Mystery Wheel."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_6
    value: "Player can win one of the followings:\n   - Coin Prizes\n   - +1 Diamond
      to Jekyll Diamond Progression\n   - +1 Diamond to Hyde Diamond Progression\n
      \  - +1 Diamond to BOTH Diamond Progression\n   - Random Free Games"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_7
    value: "Completing any type of Diamond Progression triggers the Progression Pick
      Bonus.\nThere is 30 elements in 6 columns.\nPlayer can pick any of 5 elements
      on active column and move onto the next column.\nFrom the element, one of the
      followings can be won:\n   - Coin Prize\n   - Coin Prize + Collectible\nWinning
      at least one Collectible throughout the columns allows player to re-play the
      non-collectible won columns.\nCollecting 6 Collectibles awards Top Prize. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_8
    value: "                       and\n\nbecome Walking Wilds. \nWalking Wilds move
      left or right, depending on the type.\nThere is a re-trigger symbol on all reels
      that gives +1 free spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_9
    value: "Each spin, the lowest symbol at current spin is removed from the reel
      strips except Wilds and Highs. \r\nThere is a re-trigger symbol on 5th reel
      that gives +1 free spin."
